"""Opt-in mail realism profile; invented data only, never private examples."""
import re
PROFILE = "mail-realism-v1"
GUIDANCE = """Generation profile mail-realism-v1. Write a plausible received email, not an explanation of a category. Use invented names, organizations and reserved example.org domains only. Respect the requested length and format, including subject-only mail, messy HTML-to-text artifacts, links, Unicode punctuation, signatures and quoted histories. Do not copy real brands, correspondence or private identifying information. Never disclose intended labels or generation metadata in the content. Empty body is valid when the subject supplies readable evidence. Use the length requested by the scenario and the provider completion-token budget. Do not silently truncate text."""
REVIEW_GUIDANCE = """Classify communicative purpose rather than topic keywords or delivery frequency. An automated application receipt/rejection, task deadline, delivery failure, authentication notice, or report-available notice is an operational alert even if warmly worded. An account statement or retained application-data copy can also be transactions/records; an acknowledgement alone need not be a transaction. A past meeting recap/notes-ready notice is an alert, not a new invitation or group discussion merely because it says someone invited a recorder or mentions discussions. Current meeting confirmation/reminder/reschedule is scheduling and can also be an alert. A product release changelog can be both curated publication and operational update. A delivered editorial article is not promotional merely because it has subscription links. Judge concrete persuasive outreach separately. Ignore obsolete quoted invitations and generic calendar/signature/footer links. Informative subject-only operational reports remain observable alerts; attachments do not reveal unseen contents. Missing context must not become seven negative labels. Return unknown for genuinely undecidable purposes, with exact visible positive evidence."""

def profile_valid(content):
    if not isinstance(content, dict) or set(content) != {"subject", "body"}:
        return False
    for key in ("subject", "body"):
        value = content[key]
        if not isinstance(value, str):
            return False
        if re.search(r"[\x00-\x08\x0b\x0c\x0e-\x1f\x7f]", value):
            return False
    return any(v.strip() for v in content.values())

# Named v2 preserves the v1 prompt for reproducibility.
BOUNDARY_POLICY_V2 = "Boundary policy lw-purpose-boundaries-v2. Judge the current communicative act, not topic words, sender brand, or generic footer. Scheduling covers a concrete invitation, booking negotiation, reschedule, cancellation or joining an already-booked event; historical invitation text in a recap is not scheduling. A pure human slot negotiation is scheduling alone: no distinct account record, triggered system notice or substantive personal advice. A recorder notes-ready recap is an operational alert, even when the template says someone invited a recorder, shows a date, or counts action items. A service-issued reminder to join a booked event is both scheduling and alert; a general future-event listing is not automatically an operational alert. A masked-account statement available through a link and an existing subscription's upcoming charge are both account records and alerts; a price quote or unaccepted consultation offer is not a transaction. A bland application acknowledgment/rejection is an alert; individualized reasoning, advice or feedback can additionally be correspondence. A short shared-document notice is an alert; the linked document's unknown content is not evidence of other purposes. Subscriber welcome/onboarding is an alert when it announces the new subscription or delivery setup; newsletter brand alone does not establish publication. Curated educational material, recurring editorial content and a multi-item changelog may be publication; promotional rhetoric and material invitations to buy, register, subscribe or join a commercial offering may independently establish promotion. Modest related-reading/social/unsubscribe footers alone do not establish promotion. Commercial sender identity alone does not establish promotion. Security news inside an editorial article is not an account alert. Ignore obsolete quoted requests, signature booking links and compliance boilerplate. If a boundary lacks enough visible evidence, return unknown for that purpose; do not force one of several defensible labels. All seven purposes are independently judged; related purposes are not mutually exclusive."
GUIDANCE_V2 = GUIDANCE.replace("Generation profile mail-realism-v1.", "Generation profile mail-realism-v2.") + " " + BOUNDARY_POLICY_V2
REVIEW_GUIDANCE_V2 = REVIEW_GUIDANCE + " " + BOUNDARY_POLICY_V2
